-- AUTO BLOCK | Doggysaken's box-check engine, simplified to one mode
-- No rectangle toggle, custom-zone mode, anti-bait, or alternate ability modes.
-- The visible box is also the actual overlap-query volume used by the check.
-- ================================================================
local AutoBlockGroup = addGroup(Tabs.AutoBlock, "Left", "Auto block", "Single box-based block check", "shield")
